<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Confirm your e-mail address</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin: 0; padding: 24px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2933; background-color: #ffffff;">
    <p>Hello {{fullName}},</p>
    <p>Please confirm your e-mail address to finish creating your Velexis account.</p>
    <p><a href="{{verifyUrl}}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 6px; background-color: #1d4ed8; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;">Confirm e-mail address</a></p>
    <p style="color: #52606d; font-size: 13px;">If the button does not work, open this link: <a href="{{verifyUrl}}">{{verifyUrl}}</a></p>
    <p>The link is valid for 24 hours. If you did not sign up for Velexis, you can ignore this e-mail.</p>
    <p>The Velexis team</p>
  </body>
</html>
